!!Summary

||__Cmavo__|__Article__|__Cmevla__|__In-mind__|__Key phrase__|__Outer quantifier__|__Inner quantifier__|__Defaults__

lo|Generic|No|irrelevant|fits|over instances|~~#FF0000:cardinality of group~~|~~#FF0000:none~~
le|Specific|No|Yes|described as|over members|cardinality of group|~~#FF0000:none~~
la|Name|Yes|Yes|named with|over members|part of the name|~~#FF0000:none~~

lo'i|Generic set|No|irrelevant|has only members that fit|~~#FF0000:over instances~~|~~#FF0000:cardinality of set~~|~~#FF0000:none~~
le'i|Specific set|No|Yes|has only members described as|selects subset|cardinality of set|~~#FF0000:none~~
la'i|Name set|Yes|Yes|has only members named with|selects subset|part of the name|~~#FF0000:none~~

loi|Generic mass|No|irrelevant|fit and collectively satisfy|~~#FF0000:over instances~~|~~#FF0000:cardinality of group~~|~~#FF0000:none~~
lei|Specific mass|No|Yes|described as and collectively satisfy|selects subgroup|cardinality of group|~~#FF0000:none~~
lai|Name mass|Yes|Yes|named with and collectively satisfy|selects subgroup|part of the name|~~#FF0000:none~~

lo'e|Typical|No|irrelevant|those that fit typically satisfy|unclear|~~#FF0000:cardinality of group~~|~~#FF0000:none~~
le'e|Stereotypical|No|Yes|those described as are said to typically satisfy|unclear|cardinality of group|~~#FF0000:none~~

